<title>USA: TABLE - Albank Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Albank Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, N.Y. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.68		    $0.54</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.68		     0.54</p>
<p> Net			  9,441		    7,835</p>
<p> Net int. income	 33,450		   31,242</p>
<p> Nonint. income	   3,509		    3,092</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	   1,800		    1,425</p>
<p> Total assets	 3,529,886		3,329,774</p>
<p> Return on equity	 11.62		     9.83</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.35		    $1.07</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.35		     1.07</p>
<p> Net			 18,758		   15,546</p>
<p> Net int. income	 66,486		   62,134</p>
<p> Nonint. income	   6,766		    6,102</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	   3,600		    2,850</p>
<p> Total assets	 3,511,470		3,336,211</p>
<p> Return on equity	 11.67		     9.72</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers. Return in equity is in percent.)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q2 1997 fully diluted core net income per share, excluding after-tax affect of April 1997 partial recovery of an investment written off in 1995, was $0.67 vs $0.54 for the year-ago period.</p>
<p>For the six months, EPS exluding the partial recovery was $1.34 vs $1.07.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Albank Financial Corp.</p>
